<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak June jobless dips to 12.30 pct (12.32pct).</title>
<headline>Slovak June jobless dips to 12.30 pct (12.32pct).</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slovakia's total number of people unemployed in June was 319,923, or 12.30 percent of the workforce, down from May's 12.32 percent , the National Labour Office said on Friday.</p>
<p>  SLOVAK UNEMPLOYMENT	JUNE 1997    MAY 1997  JUNE 1996</p>
<p>  Total jobless		 319,923     320,530    311,244</p>
<p>  Percentage of workforce    12.30	 12.32	12.12</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 421-7-521-8402</p>
